  "notes": "Modal is used to show a dialog or a box when you click a button.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/modal/+page.md",
  "code": "<!-- You can open the modal using ID.showModal() method -->\n<button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"my_modal_3.showModal()\">open modal</button>\n<dialog id=\"my_modal_3\" class=\"modal\">\n  <div class=\"modal-box\">\n    <form method=\"dialog\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-2 top-2\">✕</button>\n    </form>\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Hello!</h3>\n    <p class=\"py-4\">Press ESC key or click on ✕ button to close</p>\n  </div>\n</dialog>",
